# CLAUDE.md

This file provides guidance to Claude Code when working with code in this repository.

## Project Overview

{PROJECT_NAME} — a Next.js + TypeScript frontend. Material-UI, SCSS Modules, next-intl.

## Development Commands

```bash
yarn dev          # Start development server
yarn build        # Build for production
yarn lint         # Run all linters (ESLint, next lint)
yarn stylelint    # SCSS lint
yarn test:ct      # Run Playwright component tests
```

Pre-commit: Husky runs `yarn lint` on every commit.

## Architecture

### App Router with Internationalization

```
src/app/[locale]/
├── layout.tsx        # Root layout (providers, metadata, JSON-LD)
├── (home)/           # Home layout group
├── (public)/         # Public pages layout group
└── (simple)/         # Minimal layout group
```

### Key Directories

- `src/components/` — Reusable UI components
- `src/views/` — Page-level view components
- `src/i18n/` — next-intl configuration (routing, request, navigation)
- `src/styles/themes/` — MUI theme (colors, breakpoints, palette, typography, components)
- `src/config/` — Configuration files
- `src/types/` — TypeScript definitions
- `src/utils/` — Hooks and utility functions

## Import Rules

**ALWAYS use `@/` alias (never `../`):**

```typescript
import Component from '@/components/Component';   // ✅
import Component from '../components/Component';  // ❌
```

## Important Rules

1. **NEVER use `any` or `unknown`** — always define proper types
2. **NEVER use `React.memo`, `useMemo`, or `useCallback`**
3. **NEVER use MUI `sx` prop for styling** — use SCSS modules + MUI component props
4. **NEVER mix `sx` and SCSS** in same component
5. **Server components by default** — only add `'use client'` when needed
6. **ALWAYS create `index.ts`** for component folders: `import X from './X'; export default X;`
7. **SCSS module only when needed** — skip if MUI components + props are sufficient
8. **ALWAYS use `useTranslations`** — never hardcode user-facing text
9. **ALWAYS add translations to ALL locales**
10. **Use `Link` from `@/i18n/navigation`** — not `next/link`
11. **Use `next/image`** — not `<img>` tag
12. **View sections start with `Container`** — `<Container component="section">`

## Naming Conventions

- Components/Files: PascalCase (`HeroSection.tsx`)
- SCSS Modules: PascalCase + `.module.scss`
- Hooks: camelCase + `use` prefix (`useToggleState`)
- Named exports only (except pages/layouts)
